# SYD OMEGA 91717 -- backend exclusion for the public static deployment.
# The site is a static HTML/JS/CSS site (outputDirectory: "." in vercel.json).
# Everything below must never reach the public deployment. This file is the
# ONLY defense -- an earlier extension-based redirect safety net in
# vercel.json (.sql, .ts, .py, .sol, .docx -> dashboard.html) was removed for
# using invalid Vercel route-source syntax and was never restored. Do not
# assume vercel.json backs this up; keep every pattern below accurate.

# All Supabase backend -- SQL migrations, RLS policies, and Edge Function
# source. Deployed separately via the Supabase CLI/dashboard, never via Vercel.
supabase/

# Any stray backend-shaped source, wherever it ends up
*.ts
*.tsx
*.py
*.sol
*.sql

# Docs, notes, and local-only files that shouldn't ship publicly
*.md
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
.env
.env.*
*.log

# Standard tooling noise, if ever present
node_modules/
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
package.json
package-lock.json
